  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8457553d7570b1146a94bd661e6d7528, type: 3}
  m_Name: Oath of the Hearth
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MissionData
  missionName: Oath of the Hearth
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  description: 
  flavorText: 'The cold takes the careless and the slow. Hunger divides the selfish
    from the strong. If we leave our wounded behind, the tribe grows smaller with
    every storm. We gather close to the fire. We share what we hunt. We carry those
    who cannot walk. No one is lost to the night. No one is left for the predators.
    We survive as one people, or not at all.


    We swear the Oath of the Hearth.'
  splashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 28c26122733f402448edad1a403f69b9, type: 3}
  victorySplashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 28c26122733f402448edad1a403f69b9, type: 3}
  victoryFlavorText: 'The storms pass, but the tribe still stands. No one is lost
    to the cold or left for the beasts. Fires burn through the longest nights, and
    food is shared until even the weakest endure. Children who should have perished
    now run beside the hunters. The tribe learns that survival is not won by strength
    alone, but by refusing to abandon one another. This is how our people live.


    We
    live and die as one.'
  failureSplashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1463f5113e62708408f1f5d5f591c427, type: 3}
  failureFlavorText: "We tried to protect everyone.\n\nWe could not.\n\nThe cold
    takes those who cannot keep pace. Fires die in the wind, and hunger forces hard
    choices the tribe does not wish to make. Some are left behind. Some do not rise
    when morning comes. The survivors carry both food and silence as they move across
    the frozen land.\n \nSurvival can demand a terrible price. It is not guaranteed"
  earliestTurn: 0
  latestTurn: 0
